| If this project is | Read in this order, after the rules above |
|---|---|
| A published package (library) | Contributing → API → Changelog → Decisions |
| A deployed API or data service | API → API-standard → Production-readiness → Contributing |
| Something else | <!-- DECIDE: name the two or three documents someone must read before their first change, in order. If you cannot name them, the gap is the reading order, not this table. --> |

The test for whether this is right: hand it to someone who has never seen the repo,
and see whether they can make a correct first change without asking a question the
list should have answered.

