## 5. Autonomous vs. explicit skill invocation

Nobody should have to memorise skill names. Recognise intent from plain language
and act — do not wait for an exact `/command`.

**Do not restate the per-skill tiers here.** Skills that ship from a plugin declare
their own `invocation:` tier, and the plugin's generated catalogue is the source of
truth. A hand-written copy in this file cannot learn that a tier changed upstream.

